{"text": "Bg University of Missouri\n\nRationale for Budget Decisions\nby College/Division\n\nEach unit was asked to supply safeguarded initiatives, investment/revenue initiatives,\ninitiatives they were forced to forgo or reduce. These are not holistic of a// proposed\nchanges, but they do provide more insights. We hope you find them helpful.\n\nAdvancement\nSafeguarded Initiatives:\ne Mizzou: Our Time to Lead campaign and related fundraising priorities\ne Endowment\ne Staff compensation and retention initiatives\nInvestment / Revenue Initiatives:\ne Fee structure adjustment in order to maintain a right-sized fundraising staff\ne Parent fundraising programs\ne Scholarship initiatives\ne Technology and research tools, including screening resources\nProposed to Forgo or Reduce:\ne Reduced customer/donor services due to less support/processing staff\ne Reduced operating costs, including M/ZZOU Magazine\ne Reduced number of events\n\ne Reduced international fundraising efforts\n\nMU Rationale for Budgets by College and Division, FY2018",
